::  name       mantra fold triple fields gate
::  shape      triple-shape - three named fields -> sum - int (@u32)
::  invariant  folds every field of a closed triple into one @u32 by addition; the fold widens with the shape, not with the code
::  example    3 5 7 -> 15 · 0 0 0 -> 0
::  readers    Mantra · Glow Tend a2 · Ashvini
::  nib        equinox-a2-list-fold-wider-v0 · STOA335: pair..nona, not the pair alone
::
::  Ashvini a2 · the list fold widens. STOA333 folded a pair's two fields;
::  STOA335 folds every field of any closed tuple, pair through nona, which is
::  Mantra's Weave shape one rung wider: a value reduced from a bounded
::  sequence of named parts rather than from a range of naturals.
|=  sample=triple-shape
|+  sum  sample
